3. **Size and Proportions**: Diamondbacks can grow quite large, with adults reaching lengths of up to 8 feet (2.4 meters). They have a stocky build, with a thick neck and a relatively short tail compared to their body length. Their overall proportions give them a powerful and intimidating appearance.

